Omission
- [N1] Node-level omission: If the PO needs to be reworked, it needs to be created again. (reason: The model lacks the feedback loop or subsequent action to regenerate the PO after the rework step.)
- [N2] Node-level omission: i18:If the POs are mailed to the supplier, receive the inventory. (reason: No corresponding decision node or action exists to trigger inventory receipt following the mailing of POs.)
- [N3] Node-level omission: i21:If the inventory is received, proceed to receive the Packing Slip. (reason: The conditional step linking physical inventory receipt back to packing slip processing is entirely absent.)
